    "bounding box" : [ 70.92, 539.77, 435.48, 573.53 ],
    "font" : "SFRM1000",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "rcλrc = v−(e−)2 + v+(e+)2 = v(e+ − e)(e−)2 + v(e − e−)(e+)2. Dividing by v and using e = rc/v, we get"
