    "bounding box" : [ 70.92, 495.85, 524.439, 529.61 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "eλrc = (e+ − e)(e−)2 + (e − e−)(e+)2 = e((e+)2 − (e−)2) + e−e+(e− − e+). (1) Note that e+ − e− = 1, so (e+)2 − (e−)2 = e+ + e−, thus"
